          },
          {
            "id": "/page/873/Text/12",
            "block_type": "Text",
            "html": "<p block-type=\"Text\"><i>(b)</i> Repairs shall be made utilizing welding procedures qualified in accordance with ASME Section IX and repair welding shall be done by welders or welding operators meeting the qualification requirements of ASME Section IX.</p>",
            "polygon": [
